  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[8.2.0] - 2026-04-19\n      - Added error handling for transaction rollbacks\n      [8.1.2] - 2026-02-09\n      - Added overloads for InTransaction and InTransactionAsync for return by value\n      [8.1.1] - 2026-02-12\n      - Added additional converters for datetime types\n      - Added extensions for autoresolved query ordering\n      - Fixed query ordering in default repository\n      [8.1.0] - 2026-01-11\n      - TransactionContext now isolated per DatabaseFacade\n      - UnitOfWork is now disposable\n      - UnitOfWork now creates its own DbContext instance by using the provided factory\n      - UnitOfWork no longer implements Attach/Detach methods\n      - Repositories now implement Attach/Detach methods\n      - GenericRepository renamed to DefaultRepository\n      - Sql queries now contain SqlFirstOrDefaultAsync/RawSqlFirstOrDefaultAsync methods\n      - Sql queries now return IReadOnlyList instead of array to improve performance (less reallocations)",
